The "scum" in "scumming" is a verb meaning "to remove the scum from
something" -- it originally referred to things like "level scumming",
which meant going up and down stairs until a good level came up, or
"store scumming" which is resting numerous turns until the shopkeepers
change their inventories.  "save scumming" is just an extension of
that; it has nothing to do with calling someone "scum".

